# Bundled benchmark data must ship with the package (overrides *.npz above).
# Listed file by file: the data directory also accumulates local scratch
# datasets that no benchmark module loads, and those must stay untracked.
!daedalus/benchmarks/data/au_mic_tess_s1.npz
!daedalus/benchmarks/data/kic6603624_pds.npz
!daedalus/benchmarks/data/sdss_galaxy.npz
!daedalus/benchmarks/data/wasp47_tess_multisector.npz
!daedalus/benchmarks/data/wasp47_tess_s42.npz

# Manuscript material is kept local and is not distributed with the code:
# the LaTeX source, the bibliography, and the scripts that render its figures.
paper/
figures/

# Local-only design, spec, and working notes
*_spec.md
*_design.md
*_handoff.md
docs/path2_robust_likelihood.md
sources/

# Docs build
docs/_build/
docs/api/_autogen/
# Local reStructuredText copy of docs/algorithm.md; there is no Sphinx build,
# so the Markdown version is the single tracked source.
docs/algorithm.rst

# scripts/ is an allow-list: it holds exactly the code that reproduces a
# result in the published paper, and nothing else. Exploratory runs,
# kernel studies, and one-off diagnostics stay local. To publish a new
# script, add it here alongside an entry in scripts/README.md.
scripts/*
!scripts/README.md
!scripts/insertion_index.py
!scripts/diabetes_paper.py
!scripts/diabetes_dummy_ablation.py
!scripts/hd10180_lovis_labelled.py
!scripts/hd10180_de_campaign.py
!scripts/hd10180_paper_run.py
!scripts/hd10180_fake_planet.py
!scripts/hd10180_fixed_dim_bf.py
!scripts/hd10180_rb_b.py
!scripts/insertion_index_hd10180.py
!scripts/insertion_index_validate.py
!scripts/sx_car_reduce.py
!scripts/sx_car_run.py
!scripts/kic_peak_bagging.py
!scripts/real_data_chains.py
!scripts/real_data_confirmatory.py
!scripts/sdss_emission_lines.py
!scripts/sbc_paper.py
!scripts/sbc_diagnostic_nlive.py
!scripts/sbc_rao_blackwell_validate.py
!scripts/sbc_is_rb_validate.py
!scripts/polynomial_scaling.py
!scripts/polynomial_scaling_extra.py
